          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYU, “ahaaghwana gisilga jea eenuuseada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fugiga shaah gisilgean gwanuuseada, ak gaweay nea meabwara, ak gwahinda geat gili mandeawana giidiinyeanda, ak gwayi fugiga shaaydaan, ‘Eakghaambiida NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba neabaruurji’; ak eara jeagiischoodiga ea mabwayda saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aniini maydabwayda gicha fiisu bea ng'eanyiidean, nih gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ging'ulayi gaygaba nih aayiinyi geatindeaba nuut, ea geatinga sugoocheanda, ak gaweay jeedeaba ng'eanyiini ak ea maydaweat aba geatinga nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaahuuyi jeagiischoocheanda gisilga jea eenuuseada, was gisilga munyas manda uurjeenga. Ak ghaanyaschi bayi iyeenya, ak dea madeeda geaguuri dagheerjeanduumeeda, nea deaba iyeenya geaguuri guuyeeda, ak ghaahaaghwi gisilga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaabwarji jeagiischoodi samwagu aba jeemba sheanagi, aba gideaba neaburji aba badahuuka nyaawa, ak eara saawa ea nibur aba badaydeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geayeeshi, “Mutawoos jeagiischoocheandeang'wa, dea gasa ghami dami, dea jea eabwar geabwar, ak gea abit daba siisi ak banyeespa nuut.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geageanu bileangidida iteanyu siguura dagheerjeanduumeedean, ak geahirji ghoah iyeenya aba gideaba gaydageanda neajeedeanyu ghayi easinyi aba badayda buuneesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geenuus neajeeda eaweedida. Nea fugiga shaah nea ghwashaayda gisilgean gang'ulean, ak ghwanal gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gabaloola jeeda ng'asheega easinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geayeeshi saawa, “Iyoadaayi gideaba ghwadoabiiw aba heedeang'wa, googoonyi gidageatindeanyu, amoadaayi mwadoabiiwa abeeda ghoanung'waadi.” Ak geegu shiliingaji diktam ea damanamughuush ghoah gidageatindeayu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, “iina jeeda shiliingajeegiga atiktam ea damanamughuushiin”–ak geajaksi jeeda shageeda siitiiwiisa lapiya bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ng'ata geahirji bugusta bileangideanyu diita bea iyeenya siguura guuyeedean, ak ghwadatas guuyeeda Yuda ea Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
